5
00:03:42,355 --> 00:03:46,593
Just apply four strokes with the brush on these walls .

6
00:03:46,593 --> 00:03:51,464
And quickly run around and polish these teak furniture .

7
00:03:51,464 --> 00:03:54,334
That 's all I 've told you to do .

8
00:03:54,334 --> 00:03:56,603
But you have been in this house with your broom and brush since

9
00:03:56,603 --> 00:03:58,195
