13
00:04:11,517 --> 00:04:17,390
You were brave enough to come so I entrusted you with the job .

14
00:04:17,390 --> 00:04:22,293
But if you are bent on cheating me then there will be trouble .

15
00:04:26,332 --> 00:04:29,569
Sharadamma from Calcutta will be here any minute now .

16
00:04:29,569 --> 00:04:33,439
Are you planning to stay here with your broom until then ?

17
00:04:33,439 --> 00:04:39,512
Let me tell you one thing , do as much as you can today and stop .

18
00:04:39,512 --> 00:04:44,584
After that I don 't want you loitering here for this purpose .

19
00:04:44,584 --> 00:04:46,848
I won 't pay you any wages for that then .

20
00:04:48,855 --> 00:04:52,154
Can 't you hear me ?

21
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:57,523
I wonder where he is ... Is he hiding somewhere painting ...

22
00:04:58,398 --> 00:04:59,524
Raghava ...

23
00:05:04,337 --> 00:05:05,361
Raghava ...

24
00:05:07,507 --> 00:05:09,372
Rajappa ...

25
00:05:09,575 --> 00:05:11,008
My God ...

26
00:05:48,314 --> 00:05:50,145
My umbrella ...

27
00:06:04,564 --> 00:06:07,795
Vaidyare ...

28
00:06:11,571 --> 00:06:15,575
The letter for you is va ... do you know any song starting with va ...

29
00:06:15,575 --> 00:06:20,446
I know a lot of things with va ... I 've been calling you for long ,

30
00:06:20,446 --> 00:06:23,416
If you happen to see Dasappankutty , ask him to come

31
00:06:23,416 --> 00:06:27,520
home to take out the bucket which fell into the well .

32
00:06:27,520 --> 00:06:28,782
Don 't forget ...

33
00:06:39,632 --> 00:06:43,569
Had been to Maadampally house that 's why I am late .

34
00:06:43,569 --> 00:06:47,573
Your daughter had been here , she just left from here .

35
00:06:47,573 --> 00:06:50,576
Is that all . Now what 's happening here ...

36
00:06:50,576 --> 00:06:55,314
I just asked Warrior to tell me a song starting with the letter pa ...

37
00:06:55,314 --> 00:07:02,355
Then ... did he sleep over it ... - Yes . And I gave him Ta .

38
00:07:02,355 --> 00:07:06,325
Then ... here it is ...

39
00:07:06,325 --> 00:07:10,563
Without taking the key at dawn from the ...

40
00:07:10,563 --> 00:07:14,367
Wait ... say that ... without giving the key ...

41
00:07:14,367 --> 00:07:18,337
Yes , of course ... Without taking the key at ...

42
00:07:18,337 --> 00:07:22,899
It 's not like that , what 's wrong with you today ?

43
00:07:24,343 --> 00:07:27,608
I have not taken it , that 's all ...

44
00:07:27,980 --> 00:07:33,453
I 've forgotten to take the key from Maadampally house .

45
00:07:33,453 --> 00:07:36,322
Dasappa , that girl from the Thekkedath house has been

46
00:07:36,322 --> 00:07:40,359
looking for you . She said that a bucket has fallen into the well .

47
00:07:40,359 --> 00:07:42,054
I know of it . I am going there now .

48
00:07:48,367 --> 00:07:49,095
Who 's it ?

49
00:07:51,370 --> 00:07:54,507
Oh it 's you ! - Where are you going ?

50
00:07:54,507 --> 00:07:57,343
I was on the way to your place . Has it been taken out ?

51
00:07:57,343 --> 00:07:58,578
No , but how come you know of it ?

52
00:07:58,578 --> 00:08:02,448
Our vaidyar told me . You should have sent Alli to me earlier .

53
00:08:02,448 --> 00:08:04,383
But I haven 't been to the house as yet .

54
00:08:04,383 --> 00:08:06,578
Then come . Well go together and get it out .

55
00:08:08,521 --> 00:08:11,457
Are you not afraid of going out at night ?

56
00:08:11,457 --> 00:08:14,688
Me , of course not . Are you afraid ?

57
00:08:15,495 --> 00:08:16,562
Not at all . I thought of taking it tomorrow

58
00:08:16,562 --> 00:08:18,397
but I won 't get sleep until I take it .

59
00:08:18,397 --> 00:08:20,533
It 's the heat . I 'll take it out and give it to you .

60
00:08:20,533 --> 00:08:22,435
Once you pour few mugs of water over you , you 'll feel better

61
00:08:22,435 --> 00:08:27,540
If only I could get a shovel from some where ... - A shovel , what for ?

62
00:08:27,540 --> 00:08:30,443
That 's not necessary , III get into the well .

63
00:08:30,443 --> 00:08:32,578
But why do you have to enter a well to take out the key from

64
00:08:32,578 --> 00:08:34,380
Maadampally house .

65
00:08:34,380 --> 00:08:36,549
If you take the key , then what about the bucket ?

66
00:08:36,549 --> 00:08:40,553
Bucket ! What bucket ? - The bucket that fell into the well .

67
00:08:40,553 --> 00:08:45,391
What 's wrong with you , you kept on saying , you 'll take it out .

68
00:08:45,391 --> 00:08:47,527
Are you trying to fool me ? You just come with me now .

69
00:08:47,527 --> 00:08:49,462
Where are we going ?

70
00:08:49,462 --> 00:08:51,497
Didn 't you understand ? ... to Maadampally house .

71
00:08:51,497 --> 00:08:53,566
At this time of night . I thought we were going to take out

72
00:08:53,566 --> 00:08:54,567
the bucket .

73
00:08:54,567 --> 00:08:57,900
You don 't have to think a lot just come with me .

74
00:09:02,542 --> 00:09:05,411
On which day were you born ?

75
00:09:05,411 --> 00:09:07,480
A Friday . - Oh ! So , afraid . Is it ?

76
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:09,448
Talk softly ...

77
00:09:09,448 --> 00:09:14,420
If you are afraid , just sing a song . I am going to sing one .

78
00:09:14,420 --> 00:09:15,352
I 'll kill you .

79
00:09:21,561 --> 00:09:26,055
Hey ... - What 's it ? - Who has opened the door ?

80
00:09:27,333 --> 00:09:29,324
Just take the key ...

81
00:09:57,463 --> 00:09:59,795
Who is going there , Dasappa ?

82
00:10:24,557 --> 00:10:28,294
Yesterday night the person you saw at Maadampally is trapped

83
00:10:28,294 --> 00:10:35,334
inside . You wait here . It 's none else than that Tamilian lady .

84
00:10:35,334 --> 00:10:39,605
The fact that you did not wait there was because of your luck .

85
00:10:39,605 --> 00:10:42,341
I 've made these Talismans after praying .

86
00:10:42,341 --> 00:10:45,511
I am scared - There 's nothing to fear .

87
00:10:45,511 --> 00:10:50,549
Nothing at all . My talismans are very effective .

88
00:10:50,549 --> 00:10:56,422
Without uttering a word , tie them to the four corners of the house .

89
00:10:56,422 --> 00:10:58,117
I want to urgently go to the loo .

90
00:11:04,697 --> 00:11:05,391
- Go ...

91
00:11:21,447 --> 00:11:25,584
Yesterday night you were so afraid , it 's shameful .

92
00:11:25,584 --> 00:11:29,455
A man has to be in control of his senses . He must be brave .

93
00:11:29,455 --> 00:11:33,084
Anyway since I was present , let no one hear of this event .

94
00:11:40,399 --> 00:11:43,562
Are you hungry ? What is it ?

95
00:11:53,579 --> 00:11:56,480
I want to use the toilet

96
00:12:04,423 --> 00:12:05,515
Sister ...

97
00:12:10,429 --> 00:12:13,399
What 's it , Dasappa ?

98
00:12:13,399 --> 00:12:15,765
I have been calling out to you for so long .

99
00:12:16,435 --> 00:12:21,566
Did brother tell you anything today ? I mean tell you ?

100
00:12:22,041 --> 00:12:26,102
To me , no ... Why do you ask ?

101
00:12:26,445 --> 00:12:28,514
Then brother has had this illness for some time now .

102
00:12:28,514 --> 00:12:33,552
Why , what happened ? He went out in the morning without

103
00:12:33,552 --> 00:12:35,387
telling me a thing .

104
00:12:35,387 --> 00:12:37,590
That 's exactly how he is even now , he is not saying a word .

105
00:12:37,590 --> 00:12:39,358
No other illness .

106
00:12:39,358 --> 00:12:41,494
Not speaking . I want to see him this minute .

107
00:12:41,494 --> 00:12:43,429
Has he been taken to a hospital ?

108
00:12:43,429 --> 00:12:45,297
No , he is in the toilet .

109
00:12:45,297 --> 00:12:48,425
In the toilet ! - Yes , there 's nothing to fear . Come along .

110
00:12:49,568 --> 00:12:51,570
What senseless things are you saying ?

111
00:12:51,570 --> 00:12:54,473
Yesterday night he got a scare at Maadampally . I told him not to

112
00:12:54,473 --> 00:12:58,933
go alone if he is afraid and that III come along .

113
00:13:03,415 --> 00:13:07,419
Yesterday what happened at that house , you never said anything .

114
00:13:07,419 --> 00:13:09,182
How are you feeling now ?

115
00:13:12,391 --> 00:13:14,256
You can 't speak . Oh , God !

116
00:13:18,397 --> 00:13:20,228
What 's all this you are doing ?

117
00:13:20,432 --> 00:13:21,567
Did you see ...

118
00:13:21,567 --> 00:13:28,374
Oh God , what will I do ? Leave him . I shall go to big brother .

119
00:13:28,374 --> 00:13:32,208
I 'll ask him to give you a talisman . Leave me ...

120
00:13:32,344 --> 00:13:37,247
No need of any talisman , all he needs is an electric shock .

121
00:13:47,393 --> 00:13:48,394
He got scared .

122
00:13:48,394 --> 00:13:53,532
Yes , that 's what Dasappan said . He is just not answering me .

123
00:13:53,532 --> 00:13:57,336
If you could chant something and give it to me ...

124
00:13:57,336 --> 00:14:01,507
He may have entered there at an unsafe hour saying hymns .

125
00:14:01,507 --> 00:14:04,710
He couldn 't sleep without taking charge of the inheritance of

126
00:14:04,710 --> 00:14:07,346
those people from Calcutta . And now what happened ?

127
00:14:07,346 --> 00:14:11,016
He filled Sharadamma 's ears with tales and took the

128
00:14:11,016 --> 00:14:12,881
key to that house from me .

129
00:14:14,386 --> 00:14:17,389
Long ago famous Tantrics have chanted powerful chants and

130
00:14:17,389 --> 00:14:19,091
have exorcised the place and trapped the haunting spirits

131
00:14:19,091 --> 00:14:21,389
in a room . Your husband is new to this place .

132
00:14:21,560 --> 00:14:26,398
I told him not to have anything to do with the house .

133
00:14:26,398 --> 00:14:27,558
He never listened to me .

134
00:14:28,801 --> 00:14:33,372
Okay , I 'll give you an enchanted thread . But will he tie it .

135
00:14:33,372 --> 00:14:34,999
Yes ... - Then come .

136
00:15:00,466 --> 00:15:03,697
Give it to me ... I came first .

137
00:15:06,538 --> 00:15:09,996
Without speaking a word go and tie it .

138
00:15:10,542 --> 00:15:14,535
Hey , you will tear it ... I told you !

139
00:15:17,416 --> 00:15:20,214
What 's happening there ? - Nothing ...

140
00:15:42,408 --> 00:15:44,535
Hey , look who 's here !

141
00:15:45,577 --> 00:15:48,569
Ganga , that 's uncle .

142
00:15:51,383 --> 00:15:53,519
I thought only sister Sharada was coming .

143
00:15:53,519 --> 00:15:56,555
I had no idea you were coming too .

144
00:15:56,555 --> 00:15:58,457
So , where are the others ?

145
00:15:58,457 --> 00:16:02,257
We came alone , there 's no one else . Meet Ganga .

146
00:16:03,529 --> 00:16:05,364
Yesterday we arrived very late from Trivandrum .

147
00:16:05,364 --> 00:16:07,730
We did not want to disturb you so we went to Maadampally .

148
00:16:08,534 --> 00:16:11,437
You two stayed there alone yesterday night .

149
00:16:11,437 --> 00:16:15,541
Well , I saw the key in the door , so I asked Ganga to wait outside

150
00:16:15,541 --> 00:16:17,443
... while I went in to check if anyone was home .

151
00:16:17,443 --> 00:16:19,378
No one was there . - Then what did you do ?

152
00:16:19,378 --> 00:16:22,581
I thought it was too late to wake you all .

153
00:16:22,581 --> 00:16:24,550
So we rented a room in the town .

154
00:16:24,550 --> 00:16:31,080
Well , who is this ... do you know us ?

155
00:16:33,325 --> 00:16:37,329
How is that possible . Nakul has never brought you here after

156
00:16:37,329 --> 00:16:38,497
you were married .

157
00:16:38,497 --> 00:16:41,500
Well , ask him when was the last time he came here .

158
00:16:41,500 --> 00:16:48,374
Ganga , this is my aunt , this is her daughter Jayshree .

159
00:16:48,374 --> 00:16:51,477
How are you ? How you have grown !

160
00:16:51,477 --> 00:16:54,412
She 's Alli . My uncles daughter .

161
00:16:58,283 --> 00:17:06,190
Hey , aunt you ! Too are here . What is the occasion ? How 's uncle ?

162
00:17:07,426 --> 00:17:08,723
What ?

163
00:17:12,498 --> 00:17:16,025
Okay , don 't say a word . Just go and tie it on him .

164
00:17:20,339 --> 00:17:23,502
That is a talisman for your uncle . That 's why she is silent .

165
00:17:43,529 --> 00:17:46,396
That is uncle 's eldest daughter , Sreedevi .

166
00:17:47,332 --> 00:17:48,500
Did my aunt not come with you ?

167
00:17:48,500 --> 00:17:52,471
She was to , but my sister came and took her to Bombay .

168
00:17:52,471 --> 00:17:55,407
Anyway nowadays who wants their ancestral house .

169
00:17:55,407 --> 00:17:59,378
Don 't worry , I 've planned to stay here for a few days .

170
00:17:59,378 --> 00:18:02,108
Until the work on the new plant gets over , well stay here .

171
00:18:03,382 --> 00:18:05,247
That 's nice . Come , dear !

172
00:18:10,589 --> 00:18:16,528
I assume you will be here for 3 to 4 months . - Almost .

173
00:18:16,528 --> 00:18:19,298
Then you can stay here with us .

174
00:18:19,298 --> 00:18:22,468
No uncle , well stay at Maadampally .

175
00:18:22,468 --> 00:18:26,097
At Maadampally - Yes , why ?

176
00:18:30,342 --> 00:18:34,346
It 's true that Maadampally is your ancestral home and your mother

177
00:18:34,346 --> 00:18:41,411
is entitled to a share in it but that house is not good for staying .

178
00:18:44,323 --> 00:18:47,526
That house is haunted since some time .

179
00:18:47,526 --> 00:18:51,463
You may have heard of it in your childhood .

180
00:18:51,463 --> 00:18:54,433
There have been many untimely deaths there .

181
00:18:54,433 --> 00:18:58,403
Girls from outside families who stay there after marriage are

182
00:18:58,403 --> 00:19:05,377
harassed ... Ganga is a girl from another family

183
00:19:05,377 --> 00:19:10,315
These are all very outdated rumors . Who believes them now ?

184
00:19:10,315 --> 00:19:15,354
You don 't have to worry because I told you .

185
00:19:15,354 --> 00:19:19,324
If you have decided to stay there , go ahead .

186
00:19:22,394 --> 00:19:25,158
You can go round and see everything .

187
00:19:31,470 --> 00:19:32,835
You , come here .

188
00:19:49,488 --> 00:19:53,392
Now I have a few words to say to you ...

189
00:19:53,392 --> 00:19:56,156
Did you think I 've lost my tongue ? - No

190
00:19:56,361 --> 00:19:57,529
So your illness has disappeared .

191
00:19:57,529 --> 00:20:03,535
Yes it has . I shall remove any other illness I had in the morning

192
00:20:03,535 --> 00:20:07,072
What did you say ? I should be given an electric shock .

193
00:20:07,072 --> 00:20:08,574
Who do you think you are to give me an electric shock ?

194
00:20:08,574 --> 00:20:10,940
Are you a lineman with the Electricity board ? You ...

195
00:20:45,510 --> 00:20:50,277
Don 't come close or play games with me . Ill stab you .

196
00:21:23,415 --> 00:21:26,384
That is Nakul 's wife Ganga .

197
00:21:31,423 --> 00:21:34,449
I will hit you ... Don 't follow me .

198
00:21:59,351 --> 00:22:01,512
You are coming from behind to scare me ?

199
00:22:05,357 --> 00:22:07,018
What is it , Vasudha ?

200
00:22:12,431 --> 00:22:16,197
What is it you want ? ... Tell me .

201
00:22:22,307 --> 00:22:26,244
What is this you are doing ? If anybody sees us , it 's shameful .

202
00:22:26,244 --> 00:22:29,614
It 's true , we are husband and wife , if you want III come home .

203
00:22:29,614 --> 00:22:34,052
I said III come home . Trust me .

204
00:22:34,052 --> 00:22:40,292
Leave me . What has happened to you to behave like this ?

205
00:22:40,292 --> 00:22:44,490
If anyone sees us then we would rather die .

206
00:22:45,330 --> 00:22:48,197
Sreedevi ...

207
00:22:57,342 --> 00:22:58,900
Stop pulling me .

208
00:23:02,447 --> 00:23:04,312
Where are you taking me ?

209
00:23:22,434 --> 00:23:35,480
No one told me that they are coming back but yet

210
00:23:35,480 --> 00:23:47,221
I keep my door half-open everyday .

211
00:23:48,360 --> 00:24:01,000
Always , I wish someone dear to me will come .

212
00:24:06,311 --> 00:24:10,111
It 's so quiet here . Such a nice atmosphere .

213
00:24:10,849 --> 00:24:12,551
Do you like it here , Ganga ?

214
00:24:12,551 --> 00:24:17,147
Of course , it 's so much better than what I had expected .

215
00:24:21,460 --> 00:24:23,395
Aren 't you coming to sleep ?

216
00:24:23,395 --> 00:24:26,831
Lm feeling sleepy . - You sleep .

217
00:24:57,295 --> 00:25:00,332
Are all these books yours , sister ? - Let these be

218
00:25:00,332 --> 00:25:04,632
kept here for now . We will shift them somewhere later .

219
00:25:09,374 --> 00:25:13,578
What is it ? - Have you read this ? - Yes , Why ?

220
00:25:13,578 --> 00:25:19,574
The author is my teacher in the college - Is it P. Mahadevan ?

221
00:25:23,355 --> 00:25:26,424
He is ... - Then what ...

222
00:25:26,424 --> 00:25:31,463
You know it . - No ... - Yes , you know .

223
00:25:31,463 --> 00:25:33,522
Mother must have told everything to you .

224
00:25:34,366 --> 00:25:38,598
What ? - Nothing , sister

225
00:25:41,540 --> 00:25:42,939
Alli ! Wait ...

226
00:25:46,444 --> 00:25:49,140
What is it ? Tell me , what 's the matter ?

227
00:25:50,549 --> 00:25:52,983
My marriage has been fixed .

228
00:25:54,319 --> 00:25:57,522
Why didn 't you tell me earlier ? Has everything been finalized .

229
00:25:57,522 --> 00:26:02,127
Yes , in July . He stays in the adjacent house .

230
00:26:02,127 --> 00:26:04,595
Where ? - See there .

231
00:26:23,381 --> 00:26:27,519
I want a room to arrange all my books neatly .

232
00:26:27,519 --> 00:26:29,521
I have been looking for one since yesterday .

233
00:26:29,521 --> 00:26:33,592
There are so many rooms here . Come , III show you .

234
00:26:33,592 --> 00:26:36,361
I don 't want just any room . I want a room with windows

235
00:26:36,361 --> 00:26:40,821
looking out to the mango orchard . - Come , lets see .

236
00:26:55,347 --> 00:26:59,249
No one ever comes here . - Come , let us see .

237
00:27:32,317 --> 00:27:36,253
Sister , I think that room faces the East .

238
00:27:54,339 --> 00:27:57,399
See , there is some talisman tied here .

239
00:28:05,383 --> 00:28:06,551
Its locked too .

240
00:28:06,551 --> 00:28:11,322
That 's alright . We can get the key from father .

241
00:28:11,322 --> 00:28:16,658
Daughter ... - I think it is uncle . - Come , lets go .

242
00:28:30,442 --> 00:28:32,069
Come , dear .

243
00:28:34,479 --> 00:28:37,004
Where have you been ? - Upstairs .

244
00:28:39,284 --> 00:28:44,289
This is an old house . There are certain limitations here .

245
00:28:44,289 --> 00:28:49,192
There are rooms on the Southern side , where no one ever goes .

246
00:28:52,330 --> 00:28:56,534
Those rooms have been locked up after certain Tantric rituals .

247
00:28:56,534 --> 00:29:03,633
Every year during Durgashtami festival these rituals are done .

248
00:29:07,545 --> 00:29:11,216
The souls of two youngsters who had untimely deaths were

249
00:29:11,216 --> 00:29:13,013
exorcised and trapped in there .

250
00:29:13,485 --> 00:29:17,979
Today 's youth might not believe it .

251
00:29:19,457 --> 00:29:24,485
You don 't go there , That 's what , I came to tell you .

252
00:29:25,063 --> 00:29:27,588
Why should we challenge the dead ?

253
00:29:35,440 --> 00:29:37,442
Who were these people who died ?

254
00:29:37,442 --> 00:29:43,581
Some 150 years ago there was a powerful Nobleman .

255
00:29:43,581 --> 00:29:49,287
He brought a dancer from Tanjavur , and she stayed here .

256
00:29:49,287 --> 00:29:53,525
Her name was Nagavalli . She loved a third person .

257
00:29:53,525 --> 00:29:57,328
He was a dancer called Ramanathan .

258
00:29:57,328 --> 00:30:03,468
Once he came in search of her and stayed in the adjacent house .

259
00:30:03,468 --> 00:30:07,372
Somehow , the Nobleman got to Know of this .

260
00:30:07,372 --> 00:30:11,934
That night he killed Nagavalli in that room upstairs .

261
00:30:14,479 --> 00:30:19,317
It is said that on the night of Durgashtami her soul took the

262
00:30:19,317 --> 00:30:25,523
form of a witch and entered that room to kill him .

263
00:30:25,523 --> 00:30:30,222
The Nobleman chanted some powerful chants and was saved .

264
00:30:31,596 --> 00:30:37,535
But after that her soul roamed this place day and night .

265
00:30:39,571 --> 00:30:44,275
Then they brought a famous Tantrik , who performed rituals .

266
00:30:44,275 --> 00:30:47,245
He managed to snare her soul into that room and secured it

267
00:30:47,245 --> 00:30:48,576
with a powerful talisman .

268
00:30:50,315 --> 00:30:54,352
Eventually the old nobleman too drank poison and died .

269
00:30:54,352 --> 00:30:58,186
His soul too is trapped in the same room .

270
00:30:58,389 --> 00:31:01,392
These are stories our grandmothers told us .

271
00:31:01,392 --> 00:31:03,428
Who knows , what is the truth ?

272
00:31:03,428 --> 00:31:09,767
Do you know who is staying now at the house Ramanathan stayed ?

273
00:31:09,767 --> 00:31:13,999
It 's Allis fiancee , a college lecturer .

274
00:31:20,511 --> 00:31:25,316
Your mother has often told me that there are many valuable

275
00:31:25,316 --> 00:31:26,551
things in this house .

276
00:31:26,551 --> 00:31:30,455
I 've looked everywhere but never saw a thing .

277
00:31:30,455 --> 00:31:33,558
I think it might have all been kept in that locked room .

278
00:31:33,558 --> 00:31:38,296
So that no one would enter to steal those things , all these

279
00:31:38,296 --> 00:31:42,062
ghost stories may have been made up .

280
00:31:42,400 --> 00:31:48,473
I want to open that room . What do you say ?

281
00:31:48,473 --> 00:31:50,338
Open it if you want to .

282
00:32:17,302 --> 00:32:20,538
They just came and gave the key .

283
00:32:20,538 --> 00:32:23,408
Better open it before anyone comes here .

284
00:32:23,408 --> 00:32:25,774
Shall I go now ? Have to go to college . I will come later .

285
00:33:59,504 --> 00:34:06,876
Come once and see ...

286
00:34:14,519 --> 00:34:20,719
Wont you seek the gate ? Please come ...

287
00:34:27,565 --> 00:34:37,575
Let me get a glance of you today ...

288
00:34:37,575 --> 00:34:42,480
Just once ...

289
00:34:42,480 --> 00:34:53,015
Please fulfill my longing to see you ... Fulfill it .

290
00:35:20,184 --> 00:35:23,488
That room has been barred and protected for a long time now .

291
00:35:23,488 --> 00:35:25,256
Father too warned you , yet you got a key made to open it .

292
00:35:25,256 --> 00:35:31,496
I came to stop you , but you seem to have opened it already .

293
00:35:31,496 --> 00:35:36,367
It wasn 't the right thing to do . Now I wonder what will happen .

294
00:35:36,367 --> 00:35:39,370
What is there to fear if I have opened a room in the house in

295
00:35:39,370 --> 00:35:41,339
which we are staying is what I fail to understand .

296
00:35:41,339 --> 00:35:43,508
Do you believe all this ?

297
00:35:43,508 --> 00:35:45,510
How can I not believe ?

298
00:35:45,510 --> 00:35:51,516
The locksmith who made this key is bedridden with sores on him .

299
00:35:51,516 --> 00:35:56,387
And that boy , Chandu 's friend who took the key to be made

300
00:35:56,387 --> 00:35:58,287
he is down with fever too .

301
00:35:59,590 --> 00:36:04,721
I and Chandu will stay here for a few days just in case ...

302
00:36:07,031 --> 00:36:14,802
If at all anything happens we will all bear it together .

303
00:36:22,513 --> 00:36:28,419
Until I get this pooja done for repentance , and install this holy

304
00:36:28,419 --> 00:36:33,880
vessel in that room and tie a holy thread , I will not get peace .

305
00:38:44,555 --> 00:38:55,566
Someone is going to come this way one day . I know that .

306
00:38:55,566 --> 00:39:06,410
A dear one will come this way is what I always wish for .

307
00:39:06,410 --> 00:39:11,143
Even now it 's what I hope for today .

308
00:39:12,450 --> 00:39:17,421
Many a time has the season of flowers lost its way

309
00:39:17,421 --> 00:39:23,223
there are no flowers on the mango tree branches ...

310
00:39:23,427 --> 00:39:33,564
For that alone there should be a season when it blooms .

311
00:39:56,460 --> 00:40:06,995
I know there 's no one to come yet I wait at the door ...

312
00:40:07,405 --> 00:40:17,508
Without knowing for whom it is , I wait inside the door expectantly

313
00:40:18,449 --> 00:40:23,216
I wait expectantly .

314
00:40:24,422 --> 00:40:33,854
A person dear to me will come is what I wish for always ...

315
00:40:46,444 --> 00:40:52,316
With promises to meet again , he left me ...

316
00:40:52,316 --> 00:40:56,946
I knew he would not come ...

317
00:40:57,421 --> 00:41:06,819
But I stand at the main door regularly , waiting for him .

318
00:41:08,466 --> 00:41:13,304
A person dear to me will come .

319
00:41:13,304 --> 00:41:18,298
At the door like a statue I wait hoping you will come .

320
00:41:41,499 --> 00:41:51,704
Unexpectedly , I felt that I heard someone 's footsteps .

321
00:41:52,510 --> 00:42:02,317
The spring should bring something and remain forever .

322
00:42:03,454 --> 00:42:07,481
If it should bring something ...

323
00:42:09,326 --> 00:42:19,702
At times , I run with hope on to the path with eager eyes

324
00:42:20,437 --> 00:42:30,548
someone who lost his way has come and gone ...

325
00:43:33,377 --> 00:43:36,369
Will you sing a song in that Raga ?

326
00:43:38,349 --> 00:43:41,841
Who are you ? - Me only , Nagavalli ...

327
00:43:48,425 --> 00:43:49,824
Oh God ...

328
00:45:51,548 --> 00:45:55,419
Nakul brother , Ganga ...

329
00:45:55,419 --> 00:46:01,654
Wake up , someone is knocking at the door . I think it is Sreedevi .

330
00:46:09,566 --> 00:46:10,667
What happened ?

331
00:46:10,667 --> 00:46:15,339
Please come , the maid has seen something and she 's screaming

332
00:46:15,339 --> 00:46:18,137
with fear . She is breathless and has a pain in her chest .

333
00:46:26,350 --> 00:46:29,046
What is it ? ... What happened ?

334
00:46:29,386 --> 00:46:31,752
She says she saw something that scared her .

335
00:46:32,489 --> 00:46:34,116
What happened , Shanta ?

336
00:46:35,325 --> 00:46:39,318
I heard the sound of anklets and woke up .

337
00:46:39,530 --> 00:46:43,600
There she was at the window with her hair open .

338
00:46:43,600 --> 00:46:47,504
You are just hallucinating . You think of all sorts of things

339
00:46:47,504 --> 00:46:49,373
before sleeping and then get scared .

340
00:46:49,373 --> 00:46:50,897
You can sleep in the next room if you are scared here ...

341
00:47:34,418 --> 00:47:37,478
What happened ? - See , someone dropped it and it broke .

342
00:47:46,363 --> 00:47:48,465
Don 't cause unnecessary problems .

343
00:47:48,465 --> 00:47:51,593
Who is here to open her hair and walk , or break things ?

344
00:47:52,502 --> 00:47:56,438
Don 't make up stories and lose your job .

345
00:47:59,476 --> 00:48:00,067
Come ...

346
00:48:03,080 --> 00:48:04,741
Sreedevi , you too ...

347
00:48:10,921 --> 00:48:14,958
Chandu ! Who has arranged for all these people ?

348
00:48:14,958 --> 00:48:16,560
It was Uncle .

349
00:48:16,560 --> 00:48:21,298
Then ask Uncle to get rid of these people .

350
00:48:21,298 --> 00:48:23,433
They are the ones who cause trouble saying things like

351
00:48:23,433 --> 00:48:28,268
there are witches and ogres in Maadampally and ghosts ...

352
00:48:52,562 --> 00:48:54,257
What 's all this ?

353
00:49:02,472 --> 00:49:04,608
Chandu , you go to sleep . Well look into all this tomorrow .

354
00:49:04,608 --> 00:49:07,270
Go ... you too Sreedevi .

355
00:49:20,524 --> 00:49:22,321
Come , don 't be scared .

356
00:49:42,379 --> 00:49:46,717
Let me speak first and you don 't tell me any excuses .

357
00:49:46,717 --> 00:49:49,086
Just listen to what we say without any arguments .

358
00:49:49,086 --> 00:49:50,854
What is it ?

359
00:49:50,854 --> 00:49:53,490
You take Ganga and stay at some other place now itself .

360
00:49:53,490 --> 00:49:54,479
Why ?

361
00:49:54,758 --> 00:49:57,427
This house is a disturbed house .

362
00:49:57,427 --> 00:49:59,496
You don 't have to stay to know the truth .

363
00:49:59,496 --> 00:50:02,432
Let us conduct the necessary rituals , then you come back .

364
00:50:02,432 --> 00:50:07,131
I am the only person to advise you in the absence of your mother .

365
00:50:08,472 --> 00:50:11,375
There was something else that I wanted to speak to you about ...

366
00:50:11,375 --> 00:50:14,478
Don 't back-answer . Just do as we say .

367
00:50:14,478 --> 00:50:16,413
This is not the time to argue .

368
00:50:16,413 --> 00:50:19,246
Uncle , since you have spoken so much , at least let me say ...

369
00:50:20,384 --> 00:50:21,284
Its Ganga ...

370
00:50:21,284 --> 00:50:23,149
Nakul ...

371
00:50:36,400 --> 00:50:37,799
What happened ...

372
00:50:39,536 --> 00:50:41,060
Her sari caught fire .

373
00:50:41,838 --> 00:50:44,705
Ganga ...

374
00:50:51,214 --> 00:50:55,981
Ganga ... What happened ?

375
00:50:56,520 --> 00:50:59,318
Lie down . What happened ?

376
00:51:02,459 --> 00:51:04,528
I don 't know how it happened ...

377
00:51:04,528 --> 00:51:07,531
I came to know only after the sari had caught fire .

378
00:51:07,531 --> 00:51:09,299
Where did it happen ?

379
00:51:09,299 --> 00:51:12,469
I never went inside the kitchen , I was standing in the verandah .

380
00:51:12,469 --> 00:51:14,438
Was there anyone else with you ?

381
00:51:14,438 --> 00:51:17,635
There wasn 't anyone else , only I and Sreedevi .

382
00:51:20,510 --> 00:51:23,547
Don 't get up now ... - Now I am okay , you can go .

383
00:51:23,547 --> 00:51:25,572
Alli , give me a sari .

384
00:51:30,554 --> 00:51:32,112
Uncle , can you please come here ?

385
00:51:39,329 --> 00:51:40,430
What is it ?

386
00:51:40,430 --> 00:51:44,568
Don 't mind my asking you , I have few doubts .

387
00:51:44,568 --> 00:51:48,538
I can 't tell it to anyone else but you .

388
00:51:48,538 --> 00:51:52,476
Please be clear about what you want to say to me .

389
00:51:52,476 --> 00:51:59,109
I wanted to ask you if Sreedevi had any psychological problems .

390
00:52:02,486 --> 00:52:09,493
If you have ever felt anything of the sort , be free to tell me .

391
00:52:09,493 --> 00:52:11,561
We will show her to a psychiatrist .

392
00:52:11,561 --> 00:52:14,431
What are you saying ?

393
00:52:14,431 --> 00:52:17,334
You and that modern girl did things here which you should

394
00:52:17,334 --> 00:52:19,970
not have done and so all this happened .

395
00:52:19,970 --> 00:52:21,538
How can you hold Sreedevi responsible ?

396
00:52:21,538 --> 00:52:24,307
Did you know what happened here last night ?

397
00:52:24,307 --> 00:52:27,611
You would not agree to anything .

398
00:52:27,611 --> 00:52:31,481
So I came here yesterday night to install a holy vessel in that

399
00:52:31,481 --> 00:52:33,517
room without telling you .

400
00:52:33,517 --> 00:52:36,419
Do you know what we saw ?

401
00:52:36,419 --> 00:52:38,355
Would you believe it if I told you ?

402
00:52:38,355 --> 00:52:41,358
We saw that dancer from the south with our own eyes .

403
00:52:41,358 --> 00:52:43,760
Dasappan and the Tantri are witnesses .

404
00:52:43,760 --> 00:52:48,465
Oh ! So you saw it too . Then there 's no room for doubt .

405
00:52:48,465 --> 00:52:50,367
Everyone here is ...

406
00:52:50,367 --> 00:52:51,568
What do I say ...

407
00:52:51,568 --> 00:52:54,538
What senseless things , are you saying ?

408
00:52:54,538 --> 00:52:56,870
What is wrong with Sreedevi ?

409
00:52:57,374 --> 00:53:00,610
Since I am the head of the family there are a few things

410
00:53:00,610 --> 00:53:02,546
I need to do here . After that you can come here to stay .

411
00:53:02,546 --> 00:53:05,382
Will you or won 't you leave from here today ?

412
00:53:05,382 --> 00:53:09,452
No , I and Ganga won 't go away no matter what anyone says .

413
00:53:09,452 --> 00:53:12,022
You can do as you wish but I have also decided that

414
00:53:12,022 --> 00:53:13,887
something needs to be done about Sreedevi .

415
00:53:30,440 --> 00:53:32,533
What happened ? What 's the problem ?

416
00:53:33,076 --> 00:53:35,909
He is not concerned about leaving .

417
00:53:36,446 --> 00:53:39,482
He is not at all concerned about those blood-thirsty souls that

418
00:53:39,482 --> 00:53:40,817
have been let loose .

419
00:53:40,817 --> 00:53:43,720
According to him , it is my daughter , who has a problem .

420
00:53:43,720 --> 00:53:47,524
Sreedevi ! What could be wrong with her ?

421
00:53:47,524 --> 00:53:50,427
That 's something you had better ask him .

422
00:53:50,427 --> 00:53:54,887
There 's no reason she should have a problem .

423
00:54:03,406 --> 00:54:06,343
Now it was only this much , if I hadn 't noticed it could have

424
00:54:06,343 --> 00:54:10,040
been more serious . Did you hear me well ?

425
00:54:10,380 --> 00:54:16,553
We didn 't go near her . - Is it ?

426
00:54:16,553 --> 00:54:19,556
No ... Don 't cause any more trouble here now .

427
00:54:19,556 --> 00:54:24,016
Do not use the gas stove , you start using the kerosene stove .

428
00:54:30,367 --> 00:54:31,925
What is it , uncle ?

429
00:54:32,502 --> 00:54:34,800
No , it 's nothing .

430
00:54:40,410 --> 00:54:41,672
What is it ?

431
00:54:57,294 --> 00:55:03,533
Brother-in-law , listen to me , there 's something wrong with

432
00:55:03,533 --> 00:55:09,062
Sreedevi . - What ? - Something is definitely wrong .

433
00:55:12,342 --> 00:55:15,445
Yesterday , that Tamilian lady who came down from that room

434
00:55:15,445 --> 00:55:17,174
won 't disappear just like that !

435
00:55:17,480 --> 00:55:21,551
I have a doubt she has entered inside Sreedevi .

436
00:55:21,551 --> 00:55:28,013
Yes ... Come and see for yourself .

437
00:55:42,639 --> 00:55:43,867
What is it ?

438
00:55:47,377 --> 00:55:48,674
What is it ?

439
00:55:50,547 --> 00:55:53,350
It 's nothing . Nothing is wrong with you .

440
00:55:53,350 --> 00:55:56,285
You continue swinging like that till morning .

441
00:56:08,331 --> 00:56:11,266
What is it , father ?

442
00:56:16,439 --> 00:56:17,804
Daughter !

443
00:56:19,309 --> 00:56:20,037
What is it , mother ?

444
00:56:20,543 --> 00:56:25,845
What is it Uncle , Aunt ? - Nothing .

445
00:56:26,516 --> 00:56:28,006
You tell me what it is .

446
00:56:33,423 --> 00:56:36,790
I want Dr. Sunny here . There is a lot of problem here .

447
00:56:37,327 --> 00:56:40,330
Day by day the patient is going from bad to worse .

448
00:56:40,330 --> 00:56:44,164
If he can 't help now then , what use in his being a psychiatrist .

449
00:56:44,334 --> 00:56:46,598
Please inform him now .

450
00:56:52,575 --> 00:56:56,446
Uncle had wanted Sreedevi and Nakul to get married .

451
00:56:56,446 --> 00:56:59,315
But there was a problem in Sreedevi 's horoscope .

452
00:56:59,315 --> 00:57:01,551
It was however a good match with his .

453
00:57:01,551 --> 00:57:05,522
Yet Nakul 's mother was not happy and so she refused .

454
00:57:05,522 --> 00:57:09,526
In revenge , uncle got Sreedevi married on the day of Nakul 's

455
00:57:09,526 --> 00:57:12,188
... marriage to you without revealing the problem in her horoscope .

456
00:57:14,397 --> 00:57:18,959
Finally when the groom came to know of it , he sent her back .

457
00:57:19,335 --> 00:57:21,895
Since then Sreedevi is here .

458
00:57:22,505 --> 00:57:25,608
Now after you all came , she was again happy .

459
00:57:25,608 --> 00:57:30,413
But that too had to end like this . It is all ones destiny .

460
00:57:30,413 --> 00:57:36,319
If the Tamil lady from the room has entered Sreedevi then the

461
00:57:36,319 --> 00:57:41,188
nobleman , who came down with her must be around here .

462
00:57:54,571 --> 00:58:00,477
No ... Don 't come for me I say . I will prick you .

463
00:58:00,477 --> 00:58:03,580
I am only related by marriage to Basura , to this house .

464
00:58:03,580 --> 00:58:08,210
I am telling you ... don 't come near .

465
00:58:23,333 --> 00:58:26,469
Don 't come near me , nobleman .

466
00:58:26,469 --> 00:58:28,505
I have already told you not to play with me .

467
00:58:28,505 --> 00:58:34,808
I am just a relative and play with the many youngsters here

468
00:58:35,278 --> 00:58:39,476
What is it ... What is it , Uncle ?

469
00:58:40,350 --> 00:58:44,013
Uncle , What uncle , Which uncle ?

470
00:58:45,288 --> 00:58:48,424
Who has let her loose ?

471
00:58:48,424 --> 00:58:50,293
What happened , uncle ?

472
00:58:50,293 --> 00:58:55,458
You don 't call me uncle . You Tamilian lady ...

473
00:59:01,404 --> 00:59:06,409
Uncle ... - Don 't come near me . I am bad to the bad .

474
00:59:06,409 --> 00:59:09,445
Don 't call me uncle and kill me . Just go away .

475
00:59:09,445 --> 00:59:12,642
Someone save me !

476
00:59:16,586 --> 00:59:20,215
Come fast , he 's killing me ...

477
00:59:30,133 --> 00:59:30,963
Who is it ?

478
00:59:34,604 --> 00:59:36,265
Oh , so it 's you !

479
00:59:36,439 --> 00:59:38,441
Is this the mad person , you spoke of ?

480
00:59:38,441 --> 00:59:41,611
He is very violent , he should have been locked up .

481
00:59:41,611 --> 00:59:43,279
Lock me ...

482
00:59:43,279 --> 00:59:44,712
Let him go ...

483
00:59:45,548 --> 00:59:47,880
Don 't do anything to him , listen to me .

484
00:59:48,518 --> 00:59:52,322
He says he is a senior member of the family .

485
00:59:52,322 --> 00:59:55,892
What member , what senior ? He says he is Basuda 's husband .

486
00:59:55,892 --> 00:59:59,429
Who is this Basuda ? - My wife and his aunt .

487
00:59:59,429 --> 01:00:01,454
Let him go , he 's my uncle .

488
01:00:03,333 --> 01:00:04,434
Oh , your uncle !

489
01:00:04,434 --> 01:00:07,961
Yes , by marriage . - I am sorry . Don 't touch me .

490
01:00:08,705 --> 01:00:11,407
Since you came to hit me with an umbrella I thought

491
01:00:11,407 --> 01:00:13,076
there was something wrong with you .

492
01:00:13,076 --> 01:00:16,446
Anyway , I am sorry , uncle .

493
01:00:16,446 --> 01:00:19,415
He is a famous doctor from America .

494
01:00:19,415 --> 01:00:21,679
He treats Psychic cases . - Psychiatrist ? !

495
01:00:24,354 --> 01:00:29,492
Did you tell this madman there 's nothing wrong with me .

496
01:00:29,492 --> 01:00:33,428
I mean the mad-peoples doctor ?

