1227
02:30:50,408 --> 02:30:54,945
Nakulan will tell you all like a story .

1228
02:30:54,945 --> 02:30:58,549
For a Ganga who likes hearing stories .

1229
02:30:58,549 --> 02:31:01,819
He need not tell me . I know it all .

1230
02:31:01,819 --> 02:31:08,325
I have a lot of people to thank like sister Sreedevi , but

1231
02:31:08,325 --> 02:31:14,432
most of all my Nakul whom I can never repay even if I take

1232
02:31:14,432 --> 02:31:17,196
many births for loving me so much .

1233
02:31:19,503 --> 02:31:26,410
Did you hear this Ganga you loved and who loves you a lot

1234
02:31:26,410 --> 02:31:32,416
and so full of life . I am giving her back to you . Take her .

1235
02:31:32,416 --> 02:31:33,474
Catch her ...

1236
02:31:36,387 --> 02:31:40,458
You two are fortunate . No other couple in this world have

1237
02:31:40,458 --> 02:31:44,121
understood each other in so much depth . This is the truth .

1238
02:31:44,528 --> 02:31:46,597
Now you can go to the Southern room as much as you want

1239
02:31:46,597 --> 02:31:53,093
or see anything . I still have some work left . - What is it ?

1240
02:32:09,386 --> 02:32:12,082
It 's difficult to stay with a mad man .

1241
02:32:13,357 --> 02:32:17,294
It 's even more difficult to live with one who treats madness .

1242
02:32:17,294 --> 02:32:21,355
If you are ready to bear the trouble , shall I send my mother here .

1243
02:32:27,571 --> 02:32:33,009
We Christians don 't have any problems with horoscopes .

1244
02:32:36,347 --> 02:32:38,872
Listen , III send mother ...

1245
02:32:42,586 --> 02:32:44,110
Where are you all going ?

1246
02:32:44,321 --> 02:32:50,453
I want to change as fast as possible for his sake .

1247
02:32:51,061 --> 02:32:53,996
For that Calcutta is more suitable . So we are going now .

1248
02:32:54,398 --> 02:32:55,499
Even I want to come .

1249
02:32:55,499 --> 02:32:59,094
You better come fast .

1250
02:33:04,341 --> 02:33:05,740
Chandu , this one too .

1251
02:33:10,614 --> 02:33:11,808
See you , Uncle .

1252
02:33:12,483 --> 02:33:16,320
When will the master return , I wonder ?

1253
02:33:16,320 --> 02:33:19,323
Don 't be so restless . The Tamil lady is now gone .

1254
02:33:19,323 --> 02:33:21,425
The old noble-man is still around . Be careful .

1255
02:33:21,425 --> 02:33:23,327
Now there 's nothing to fear .

1256
02:33:23,327 --> 02:33:26,956
Even if the noble-man stays here permanently we are happy .

1257
02:33:31,402 --> 02:33:32,300
Vessel ...

1258
02:33:41,545 --> 02:33:46,312
How are you now . No more jumping on water ? Let me see .

1259
02:33:50,487 --> 02:33:51,886
Put out your tongue .

1260
02:33:53,324 --> 02:33:57,522
Oh ! It was this . Ill fix it . The problem was here .

1261
02:34:00,598 --> 02:34:03,500
I felt as if a bird flew from here .

1262
02:34:03,500 --> 02:34:06,370
Now you can step on water .

1263
02:34:06,370 --> 02:34:08,539
And how about a bath ? - Yes , you can take bath .

1264
02:34:08,539 --> 02:34:11,408
Then there is no problem with me now . - No .

1265
02:34:11,408 --> 02:34:12,543
That means the illness is now gone .

1266
02:34:12,543 --> 02:34:15,312
It wasn 't an illness . Just a state of mind .

1267
02:34:15,312 --> 02:34:18,449
We call it Imacus canofia Tagadi .

1268
02:34:18,449 --> 02:34:21,285
Oh , so that 's what it was . I knew that .

1269
02:34:21,285 --> 02:34:23,253
Okay , see you then . - Ok ...

1270
02:34:25,456 --> 02:34:27,048
Okay , bye .

1271
02:34:34,598 --> 02:34:43,674
No , don 't . I like something . I 've told that to a person I like here .

1272
02:34:43,674 --> 02:34:49,271
When you know of it , you must agree and bless me ... Bye .

1273
02:34:59,490 --> 02:35:07,498
Just stop . Stop ! So did Sreedevi 's madness go away .

1274
02:35:07,498 --> 02:35:11,332
Actually it was not Sreedevi who was mad . - Then who ?

1275
02:35:31,855 --> 02:35:42,433
When hopefully you stand at the doorstep ...

1276
02:35:42,433 --> 02:35:47,571
The branch of the mango tree is full of blooms ...

1277
02:35:47,571 --> 02:35:57,776
My hearts mango tree branch is blossoming

